    https://images2.minutemediacdn.com/image/upload/c_crop,x_0,y_0,w_1600,h_900/c_fill,w_2160,ar_16:9,f_auto,q_auto,g_auto/images%2FvoltaxMediaLibrary%2Fmmsport%2Fsi%2F01ktew7zqqw2a31ycqn1.jpg 3x" media="(min-width: 1080px)"><img src="https://images2.minutemediacdn.com/image/upload/c_crop,x_0,y_0,w_1600,h_900/c_fill,w_720,ar_16:9,f_auto,q_auto,g_auto/images/voltaxMediaLibrary/mmsport/si/01ktew7zqqw2a31ycqn1.jpg" alt="Wembanyama and the Spurs trail 2–0 in the NBA Finals after losing two games at Frost Bank Center." title="Wembanyama and the Spurs trail 2–0 in the NBA Finals after losing two games at Frost Bank Center." width="360" height="203" class="undefined w-full w-full" q:id="9p"></picture></div><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><div data-lead-image="true" class="flex items-center gap-4 mt-4 text-grey font-group-tiny"><figcaption q:id="9q">Wembanyama and the Spurs trail 2–0 in the NBA Finals after losing two games at Frost Bank Center. | Juan Ocampo/NBAE via Getty Images</figcaption></div></figure><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--qv q:id=9r q:key=AxY3:1--><!--qv q:id=9s q:key=NBvp:jq_3--><!--qv q:key=8X_3--><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--/qv--></div><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--qv q:id=9t q:key=AxY3:6--><!--qv q:id=9u q:key=Y0xy:jq_3--><div class="mt-8 md:mt-0" q:key="wq_2"><div class="mb-8" q:key="wq_1"><p class="font-group-tiny mb-4">In this story:</p><!--qv q:id=9v q:key=Qyyc:wq_0--><div class="relative" q:key="6a_2"><!--qv q:id=9w q:key=a6Je:6a_0--><!--qv q:key=7Z_4--><!--/qv--><script type="placeholder" hidden q:id="9x" on-document:qinit="q-DyEiX4lM.js#_hW[0]"></script><!--/qv--><div class="flex gap-2 scroll-smooth no-scrollbar overflow-x-hidden" q:id="9y"><!--qv q:s q:sref=9v q:key=--><!--qv q:id=9z q:key=BgPR:si-san-antonio-spurs-nba--><a href="https://www.si.com/nba/spurs" data-testtype="tag" class="block p-2.5 border border-solid min-w-min w-max whitespace-nowrap font-group-tiny bg-white text-secondary hover:text-primary border-secondary hover:border-primary" q:key="12_0" q:id="a0"><!--t=a1-->San Antonio Spurs<!----></a><!--/qv--><!--qv q:id=a2 q:key=BgPR:si-new-york-knicks-nba--><a href="https://www.si.com/nba/knicks" data-testtype="tag" class="block p-2.5 border border-solid min-w-min w-max whitespace-nowrap font-group-tiny bg-white text-secondary hover:text-primary border-secondary hover:border-primary" q:key="12_0" q:id="a3"><!--t=a4-->New York Knicks<!----></a><!--/qv--><!--/qv--></div></div><!--/qv--></div></div><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--/qv--></header><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--qv q:id=a5 q:key=AxY3:1--><!--qv q:id=a6 q:key=j0EP:jq_3--><!--qv q:key=RU_1--><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--qv q:id=a7 q:key=AxY3:2--><!--qv q:id=a8 q:key=f8mi:jq_2--><div class="min-w-0 flex-1" q:key="XW_1"><div class="viewablity-block"><!--qv q:s q:sref=a8 q:key=--><!--qv q:id=a9 q:key=grEV:jq_1--><!--qv q:id=aa q:key=AxY3:0--><!--qv q:id=ab q:key=hjK3:jq_3--><!--qv q:key=pd_1--><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--qv q:id=ac q:key=AxY3:1--><!--qv q:id=ad q:key=VnLw:jq_3--><figure class="player-wrapper relative aspect-video mb-[18px] bg-grey rounded-md player-wrapper-lg" on-document:qinit="q-CmJSTBVU.js#_hW[0]" q:key="7D_5" q:id="ae"><div id="mmvid" class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-full" q:id="af"></div></figure><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--qv q:id=ag q:key=AxY3:2--><!--qv q:id=ah q:key=k1xw:jq_3--><div class="article-content" q:key="QW_9"><!--qv q:id=ai q:key=ekof:QW_1--><div style="" data-vo-slot="inline_0" data-vo-instance="01ktepekm9r6#inline_0" data-vo-slot-index="0" data-vo-article-index="0" class="my-5" q:key="Os_7" q:id="aj"><!--qv q:key=Os_2--><!--/qv--></div><!--/qv--><!--qv q:id=ak q:key=v0hb:QW_2--><!--qv q:key=ft_2--><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--qv q:key=QW_6--><!--qv q:id=al q:key=vcaa:<p>The Spurs face <a href="https://www.si.com/nba/finals/chris-mannix-knicks-keep-finding-way-championship-within-reach">an uphill battle in the 2026 NBA Finals</a>.</p>--><!--qv q:id=am q:key=lY4S:mL_1--><p id="inline-text-0" class="mt-[18px] md:mt-0 mb-[18px] [&amp;_a]:text-primary my-f-1.5" q:key="0" q:id="an">The Spurs face <a href="https://www.si.com/nba/finals/chris-mannix-knicks-keep-finding-way-championship-within-reach">an uphill battle in the 2026 NBA Finals</a>.</p><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--qv q:id=ao q:key=ekof:QW_1--><div style="" data-vo-slot="inline_1" data-vo-instance="01ktepekm9r6#inline_1" data-vo-slot-index="1" data-vo-article-index="0" data-vo-after-block="inline-text" class="my-5" q:key="Os_7" q:id="ap"><!--qv q:key=Os_2--><!--/qv--></div><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--qv q:key=QW_6--><!--qv q:id=aq q:key=vcaa:<p>San Antonio has held double-digit leads in both games of the Finals against the Knicks—a 14-point lead in Game 1 and a 12-point lead in Game 2—but has no wins to show for it. New York closed out Game 1 with <a href="https://www.si.com/nba/finals/knicks-spurs-nba-finals-game-1-live-updates-scores-stats-takeaways">an 11–0 run in the final two minutes</a>, and Victor Wembanyama <a href="https://www.si.com/nfl/inside-rams-browns-negotiation-myles-garrett-trade">committed a costly turnover</a> with 11 seconds to play in the Spurs’ Game 2 loss. </p>--><!--qv q:id=ar q:key=lY4S:mL_1--><p id="inline-text-1" class="my-[18px] [&amp;_a]:text-primary my-f-1.5" q:key="0" q:id="as">San Antonio has held double-digit leads in both games of the Finals against the Knicks—a 14-point lead in Game 1 and a 12-point lead in Game 2—but has no wins to show for it. New York closed out Game 1 with <a href="https://www.si.com/nba/finals/knicks-spurs-nba-finals-game-1-live-updates-scores-stats-takeaways">an 11–0 run in the final two minutes</a>, and Victor Wembanyama <a href="https://www.si.com/nfl/inside-rams-browns-negotiation-myles-garrett-trade">committed a costly turnover</a> with 11 seconds to play in the Spurs’ Game 2 loss. </p><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--qv q:id=at q:key=ekof:QW_1--><div style="" data-vo-slot="inline_2" data-vo-instance="01ktepekm9r6#inline_2" data-vo-slot-index="2" data-vo-article-index="0" data-vo-after-block="inline-text" class="my-5" q:key="Os_7" q:id="au"><!--qv q:key=Os_2--><!--/qv--></div><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--qv q:key=QW_6--><!--qv q:id=av q:key=vcaa:<p>Now, the Spurs find themselves where 37 other teams in NBA history have been before: facing a 2–0 series deficit in the NBA Finals. </p>--><!--qv q:id=aw q:key=lY4S:mL_1--><p id="inline-text-2" class="my-[18px] [&amp;_a]:text-primary my-f-1.5" q:key="0" q:id="ax">Now, the Spurs find themselves where 37 other teams in NBA history have been before: facing a 2–0 series deficit in the NBA Finals. </p><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--qv q:id=ay q:key=ekof:QW_1--><div style="" data-vo-slot="inline_3" data-vo-instance="01ktepekm9r6#inline_3" data-vo-slot-index="3" data-vo-article-index="0" data-vo-after-block="inline-text" class="my-5" q:key="Os_7" q:id="az"><!--qv q:key=Os_2--><!--/qv--></div><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--qv q:key=QW_6--><!--qv q:id=b0 q:key=vcaa:<h3>RELATED: <a href="https://www.si.com/nba/finals/did-spurs-exhaust-themselves-vs-thunder-wemby-thinks-so-nba-history-agrees">Did the Spurs Exhaust Themselves vs. the Thunder? Wemby Thinks So, and NBA History Agrees</a></h3>--><!--qv q:id=b1 q:key=lY4S:mL_1--><h3 id="inline-text-3" class="my-[18px] [&amp;_a]:text-primary my-f-1.5" q:key="0" q:id="b2">RELATED: <a href="https://www.si.com/nba/finals/did-spurs-exhaust-themselves-vs-thunder-wemby-thinks-so-nba-history-agrees">Did the Spurs Exhaust Themselves vs. the Thunder? Wemby Thinks So, and NBA History Agrees</a></h3><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--qv q:id=b3 q:key=ekof:QW_1--><div style="" data-vo-slot="inline_4" data-vo-instance="01ktepekm9r6#inline_4" data-vo-slot-index="4" data-vo-article-index="0" data-vo-after-block="inline-text" class="my-5" q:key="Os_7" q:id="b4"><!--qv q:key=Os_2--><!--/qv--></div><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--qv q:key=QW_6--><!--qv q:id=b5 q:key=vcaa:<p>Of those previous 37 teams, only five have come back to win the championship. Three others forced a Game 7 and lost. Since the first edition of the Finals in 1947, it’s been more common for teams facing a 2–0 Finals deficit to get swept (nine times) than to force a Game 7 and/or complete a comeback and hoist the Larry O’Brien Trophy (eight times).</p>--><!--qv q:id=b6 q:key=lY4S:mL_1--><p id="inline-text-4" class="my-[18px] [&amp;_a]:text-primary my-f-1.5" q:key="0" q:id="b7">Of those previous 37 teams, only five have come back to win the championship. Three others forced a Game 7 and lost. Since the first edition of the Finals in 1947, it’s been more common for teams facing a 2–0 Finals deficit to get swept (nine times) than to force a Game 7 and/or complete a comeback and hoist the Larry O’Brien Trophy (eight times).</p><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--qv q:id=b8 q:key=ekof:QW_1--><div style="" data-vo-slot="inline_5" data-vo-instance="01ktepekm9r6#inline_5" data-vo-slot-index="5" data-vo-article-index="0" data-vo-after-block="inline-text" class="my-5" q:key="Os_7" q:id="b9"><!--qv q:key=Os_2--><!--/qv--></div><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--qv q:key=QW_6--><!--qv q:id=ba q:key=vcaa:<p>The Spurs don’t have to look too far back in league annals to find an example of a team to overcome it, though. In 2021, Giannis Antetokounmpo and the Bucks trailed the Suns 2–0 after losing the first two games of the Finals by a total of 23 points. Just about every pundit proclaimed the series was over until Antetokounmpo turned things around in Game 3, and the Bucks went on to win the title in six games.</p>--><!--qv q:id=bb q:key=lY4S:mL_1--><p id="inline-text-5" class="my-[18px] [&amp;_a]:text-primary my-f-1.5" q:key="0" q:id="bc">The Spurs don’t have to look too far back in league annals to find an example of a team to overcome it, though. In 2021, Giannis Antetokounmpo and the Bucks trailed the Suns 2–0 after losing the first two games of the Finals by a total of 23 points. Just about every pundit proclaimed the series was over until Antetokounmpo turned things around in Game 3, and the Bucks went on to win the title in six games.</p><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--qv q:id=bd q:key=ekof:QW_1--><div style="" data-vo-slot="inline_6" data-vo-instance="01ktepekm9r6#inline_6" data-vo-slot-index="6" data-vo-article-index="0" data-vo-after-block="inline-text" class="my-5" q:key="Os_7" q:id="be"><!--qv q:key=Os_2--><!--/qv--></div><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--qv q:key=QW_6--><!--qv q:id=bf q:key=vcaa:<p>Here’s a look at every team to face a 2–0 deficit in the Finals and how it went:</p>--><!--qv q:id=bg q:key=lY4S:mL_1--><p id="inline-text-6" class="my-[18px] [&amp;_a]:text-primary my-f-1.5" q:key="0" q:id="bh">Here’s a look at every team to face a 2–0 deficit in the Finals and how it went:</p><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--qv q:id=bi q:key=ekof:QW_1--><div style="" data-vo-slot="inline_7" data-vo-instance="01ktepekm9r6#inline_7" data-vo-slot-index="7" data-vo-article-index="0" data-vo-after-block="inline-text" class="my-5" q:key="Os_7" q:id="bj"><!--qv q:key=Os_2--><!--/qv--></div><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--qv q:key=QW_6--><!--qv q:id=bk q:key=vcaa:<h2>A full list of every team to trail 2–0 in NBA Finals</h2>--><!--qv q:id=bl q:key=lY4S:mL_1--><h2 id="inline-text-7" class="scroll-mt-24 my-[18px] [&amp;_a]:text-primary my-f-1.5" q:key="0" q:id="bm">A full list of every team to trail 2–0 in NBA Finals</h2><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--qv q:id=bn q:key=ekof:QW_1--><div style="" data-vo-slot="inline_8" data-vo-instance="01ktepekm9r6#inline_8" data-vo-slot-index="8" data-vo-article-index="0" data-vo-after-block="inline-text" class="my-5" q:key="Os_7" q:id="bo"><!--qv q:key=Os_2--><!--/qv--></div><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--qv q:key=QW_6--><!--qv q:id=bp q:key=vcaa:8--><!--qv q:id=bq q:key=ndZW:mL_1--><div class="overflow-auto max-w-[90vw]" q:key="xt_0"><table class="border-collapse text-left w-full"><thead><tr><th class="bg-lightGrey py-3 px-10 my-0 mx-auto" q:key="0"><p><strong>YEAR</strong></p></th><th class="bg-lightGrey py-3 px-10 my-0 mx-auto" q:key="1"><p><strong>TEAM DOWN 2–0</strong></p></th><th class=