-3 px-10 my-0 mx-auto" q:key="1"><p>Lakers</p></td><td class="py-3 px-10 my-0 mx-auto" q:key="2"><p>Celtics</p></td><td class="py-3 px-10 my-0 mx-auto" q:key="3"><p>Celtics in 5</p></td></tr><tr class="border-b-[1px] border-b-lightGrey" q:key="30"><td class="py-3 px-10 my-0 mx-auto" q:key="0"><p>1964</p></td><td class="py-3 px-10 my-0 mx-auto" q:key="1"><p>Warriors</p></td><td class="py-3 px-10 my-0 mx-auto" q:key="2"><p>Celtics</p></td><td class="py-3 px-10 my-0 mx-auto" q:key="3"><p>Celtics in 5</p></td></tr><tr class="border-b-[1px] border-b-lightGrey" q:key="31"><td class="py-3 px-10 my-0 mx-auto" q:key="0"><p>1963</p></td><td class="py-3 px-10 my-0 mx-auto" q:key="1"><p>Lakers</p></td><td class="py-3 px-10 my-0 mx-auto" q:key="2"><p>Celtics</p></td><td class="py-3 px-10 my-0 mx-auto" q:key="3"><p>Celtics in 6</p></td></tr><tr class="border-b-[1px] border-b-lightGrey" q:key="32"><td class="py-3 px-10 my-0 mx-auto" q:key="0"><p>1961</p></td><td class="py-3 px-10 my-0 mx-auto" q:key="1"><p>Hawks</p></td><td class="py-3 px-10 my-0 mx-auto" q:key="2"><p>Celtics</p></td><td class="py-3 px-10 my-0 mx-auto" q:key="3"><p>Celtics in 5</p></td></tr><tr class="border-b-[1px] border-b-lightGrey" q:key="33"><td class="py-3 px-10 my-0 mx-auto" q:key="0"><p>1959</p></td><td class="py-3 px-10 my-0 mx-auto" q:key="1"><p>Lakers</p></td><td class="py-3 px-10 my-0 mx-auto" q:key="2"><p>Celtics</p></td><td class="py-3 px-10 my-0 mx-auto" q:key="3"><p>Celtics in 4</p></td></tr><tr class="border-b-[1px] border-b-lightGrey" q:key="34"><td class="py-3 px-10 my-0 mx-auto" q:key="0"><p>1955</p></td><td class="py-3 px-10 my-0 mx-auto" q:key="1"><p>Pistons</p></td><td class="py-3 px-10 my-0 mx-auto" q:key="2"><p>Nationals</p></td><td class="py-3 px-10 my-0 mx-auto" q:key="3"><p>Nationals in 7</p></td></tr><tr class="border-b-[1px] border-b-lightGrey" q:key="35"><td class="py-3 px-10 my-0 mx-auto" q:key="0"><p>1951</p></td><td class="py-3 px-10 my-0 mx-auto" q:key="1"><p>Knicks</p></td><td class="py-3 px-10 my-0 mx-auto" q:key="2"><p>Royals</p></td><td class="py-3 px-10 my-0 mx-auto" q:key="3"><p>Royals in 7</p></td></tr><tr class="border-b-[1px] border-b-lightGrey" q:key="36"><td class="py-3 px-10 my-0 mx-auto" q:key="0"><p>1949</p></td><td class="py-3 px-10 my-0 mx-auto" q:key="1"><p>Capitols</p></td><td class="py-3 px-10 my-0 mx-auto" q:key="2"><p>Lakers</p></td><td class="py-3 px-10 my-0 mx-auto" q:key="3"><p>Lakers in 6</p></td></tr><tr class="border-b-[1px] border-b-lightGrey" q:key="37"><td class="py-3 px-10 my-0 mx-auto" q:key="0"><p>1947</p></td><td class="py-3 px-10 my-0 mx-auto" q:key="1"><p>Stags</p></td><td class="py-3 px-10 my-0 mx-auto" q:key="2"><p>Warriors</p></td><td class="py-3 px-10 my-0 mx-auto" q:key="3"><p>Warriors in 5</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--qv q:id=br q:key=ekof:QW_1--><div style="" data-vo-slot="inline_9" data-vo-instance="01ktepekm9r6#inline_9" data-vo-slot-index="9" data-vo-article-index="0" data-vo-after-block="table" class="my-5" q:key="Os_7" q:id="bs"><!--qv q:key=Os_2--><!--/qv--></div><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--qv q:key=QW_6--><!--qv q:id=bt q:key=vcaa:<p>However, the Spurs face a tougher task ahead than any of those five aforementioned championship-winning teams—the 2021 Bucks, 2016 Cavaliers, 2006 Heat, 1977 Trail Blazers and 1969 Celtics—did when they went down 2–0. All five of those teams lost the first two games of the Finals on the road, and returned to the friendly confines of their home arena for Game 3.</p>--><!--qv q:id=bu q:key=lY4S:mL_1--><p id="inline-text-9" class="my-[18px] [&amp;_a]:text-primary my-f-1.5" q:key="0" q:id="bv">However, the Spurs face a tougher task ahead than any of those five aforementioned championship-winning teams—the 2021 Bucks, 2016 Cavaliers, 2006 Heat, 1977 Trail Blazers and 1969 Celtics—did when they went down 2–0. All five of those teams lost the first two games of the Finals on the road, and returned to the friendly confines of their home arena for Game 3.</p><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--qv q:id=bw q:key=ekof:QW_1--><div style="" data-vo-slot="inline_10" data-vo-instance="01ktepekm9r6#inline_10" data-vo-slot-index="10" data-vo-article-index="0" data-vo-after-block="inline-text" class="my-5" q:key="Os_7" q:id="bx"><!--qv q:key=Os_2--><!--/qv--></div><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--qv q:key=QW_6--><!--qv q:id=by q:key=vcaa:<p>San Antonio, on the other hand, will hit the road and will play Game 3 <a href="https://www.si.com/nba/finals/every-celebrity-spotted-game-2-spurs-vs-knicks">in front of a rowdy Madison Square Garden crowd</a> that <a href="https://www.si.com/nba/finals/knicks-fans-dreams-title-within-reach-after-game-1-win-my-heart-would-stop">is starving to watch the Knicks win</a> their first title since 1973. </p>--><!--qv q:id=bz q:key=lY4S:mL_1--><p id="inline-text-10" class="my-[18px] [&amp;_a]:text-primary my-f-1.5" q:key="0" q:id="c0">San Antonio, on the other hand, will hit the road and will play Game 3 <a href="https://www.si.com/nba/finals/every-celebrity-spotted-game-2-spurs-vs-knicks">in front of a rowdy Madison Square Garden crowd</a> that <a href="https://www.si.com/nba/finals/knicks-fans-dreams-title-within-reach-after-game-1-win-my-heart-would-stop">is starving to watch the Knicks win</a> their first title since 1973. </p><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--qv q:id=c1 q:key=ekof:QW_1--><div style="" data-vo-slot="inline_11" data-vo-instance="01ktepekm9r6#inline_11" data-vo-slot-index="11" data-vo-article-index="0" data-vo-after-block="inline-text" class="my-5" q:key="Os_7" q:id="c2"><!--qv q:key=Os_2--><!--/qv--></div><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--qv q:key=QW_6--><!--qv q:id=c3 q:key=vcaa:<p>The Spurs are just the third team in history to start the NBA Finals by losing both games at home. The other two teams to do so—the 1995 Magic and 1993 Suns—lost in four and six games, respectively. </p>--><!--qv q:id=c4 q:key=lY4S:mL_1--><p id="inline-text-11" class="my-[18px] [&amp;_a]:text-primary my-f-1.5" q:key="0" q:id="c5">The Spurs are just the third team in history to start the NBA Finals by losing both games at home. The other two teams to do so—the 1995 Magic and 1993 Suns—lost in four and six games, respectively. </p><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--qv q:id=c6 q:key=ekof:QW_1--><div style="" data-vo-slot="inline_12" data-vo-instance="01ktepekm9r6#inline_12" data-vo-slot-index="12" data-vo-article-index="0" data-vo-after-block="inline-text" class="my-5" q:key="Os_7" q:id="c7"><!--qv q:key=Os_2--><!--/qv--></div><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--qv q:key=QW_6--><!--qv q:id=c8 q:key=vcaa:https://content-enrichment-service.mmsport.minutesvc.com/oembed?url=https://content-enrichment-service.mmsport.minutesvc.com/properties/si/embeds/01k60qygf4dwrqd--><!--qv q:id=c9 q:key=jBas:mL_1--><figure on-document:qidle="q-Dc7rQ7SD.js#_hW[0]" q:key="S2_2" q:id="ca"></figure><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--qv q:id=cb q:key=ekof:QW_1--><div style="" data-vo-slot="inline_13" data-vo-instance="01ktepekm9r6#inline_13" data-vo-slot-index="13" data-vo-article-index="0" data-vo-after-block="mm-content-embed" class="my-5" q:key="Os_7" q:id="cc"><!--qv q:key=Os_2--><!--/qv--></div><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--qv q:key=QW_6--><!--qv q:id=cd q:key=vcaa:<h2>Teams to trail 2–0 in NBA Finals after hosting first two games</h2>--><!--qv q:id=ce q:key=lY4S:mL_1--><h2 id="inline-text-13" class="scroll-mt-24 my-[18px] [&amp;_a]:text-primary my-f-1.5" q:key="0" q:id="cf">Teams to trail 2–0 in NBA Finals after hosting first two games</h2><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--qv q:id=cg q:key=ekof:QW_1--><div style="" data-vo-slot="inline_14" data-vo-instance="01ktepekm9r6#inline_14" data-vo-slot-index="14" data-vo-article-index="0" data-vo-after-block="inline-text" class="my-5" q:key="Os_7" q:id="ch"><!--qv q:key=Os_2--><!--/qv--></div><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--qv q:key=QW_6--><!--qv q:id=ci q:key=vcaa:14--><!--qv q:id=cj q:key=ndZW:mL_1--><div class="overflow-auto max-w-[90vw]" q:key="xt_0"><table class="border-collapse text-left w-full"><thead><tr><th class="bg-lightGrey py-3 px-10 my-0 mx-auto" q:key="0"><p><strong>YEAR</strong></p></th><th class="bg-lightGrey py-3 px-10 my-0 mx-auto" q:key="1"><p><strong>TEAM DOWN 2–0</strong></p></th><th class="bg-lightGrey py-3 px-10 my-0 mx-auto" q:key="2"><p><strong>OPPONENT</strong></p></th><th class="bg-lightGrey py-3 px-10 my-0 mx-auto" q:key="3"><p><strong>FINALS RESULT</strong></p></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class="border-b-[1px] border-b-lightGrey" q:key="0"><td class="py-3 px-10 my-0 mx-auto" q:key="0"><p>2026</p></td><td class="py-3 px-10 my-0 mx-auto" q:key="1"><p>Spurs</p></td><td class="py-3 px-10 my-0 mx-auto" q:key="2"><p>Knicks</p></td><td class="py-3 px-10 my-0 mx-auto" q:key="3"><p>TBD</p></td></tr><tr class="border-b-[1px] border-b-lightGrey" q:key="1"><td class="py-3 px-10 my-0 mx-auto" q:key="0"><p>1995</p></td><td class="py-3 px-10 my-0 mx-auto" q:key="1"><p>Magic</p></td><td class="py-3 px-10 my-0 mx-auto" q:key="2"><p>Rockets</p></td><td class="py-3 px-10 my-0 mx-auto" q:key="3"><p>Rockets in 4</p></td></tr><tr class="border-b-[1px] border-b-lightGrey" q:key="2"><td class="py-3 px-10 my-0 mx-auto" q:key="0"><p>1993</p></td><td class="py-3 px-10 my-0 mx-auto" q:key="1"><p>Suns</p></td><td class="py-3 px-10 my-0 mx-auto" q:key="2"><p>Bulls</p></td><td class="py-3 px-10 my-0 mx-auto" q:key="3"><p>Bulls in 6</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--qv q:id=ck q:key=ekof:QW_1--><div style="" data-vo-slot="inline_15" data-vo-instance="01ktepekm9r6#inline_15" data-vo-slot-index="15" data-vo-article-index="0" data-vo-after-block="table" class="my-5" q:key="Os_7" q:id="cl"><!--qv q:key=Os_2--><!--/qv--></div><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--qv q:key=QW_6--><!--qv q:id=cm q:key=vcaa:<p>Game 3 is a must-win for San Antonio. No team in NBA history has ever won a series—no matter the round—when facing a 3–0 deficit. </p>--><!--qv q:id=cn q:key=lY4S:mL_1--><p id="inline-text-15" class="my-[18px] [&amp;_a]:text-primary my-f-1.5" q:key="0" q:id="co">Game 3 is a must-win for San Antonio. No team in NBA history has ever won a series—no matter the round—when facing a 3–0 deficit. </p><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--qv q:id=cp q:key=ekof:QW_1--><div style="" data-vo-slot="inline_16" data-vo-instance="01ktepekm9r6#inline_16" data-vo-slot-index="16" data-vo-article-index="0" data-vo-after-block="inline-text" class="my-5" q:key="Os_7" q:id="cq"><!--qv q:key=Os_2--><!--/qv--></div><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--qv q:key=QW_6--><!--qv q:id=cr q:key=vcaa:<p>The Spurs will have a chance to get their championship dreams back on track when they visit the Knicks at Madison Square Garden in Game 3 on Monday. Tipoff is scheduled for 8:30 p.m. ET.</p>--><!--qv q:id=cs q:key=lY4S:mL_1--><p id="inline-text-16" class="my-[18px] [&amp;_a]:text-primary my-f-1.5" q:key="0" q:id="ct">The Spurs will have a chance to get their championship dreams back on track when they visit the Knicks at Madison Square Garden in Game 3 on Monday. Tipoff is scheduled for 8:30 p.m. ET.</p><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--qv q:id=cu q:key=ekof:QW_1--><div style="" data-vo-slot="inline_17" data-vo-instance="01ktepekm9r6#inline_17" data-vo-slot-index="17" data-vo-article-index="0" data-vo-after-block="inline-text" class="my-5" q:key="Os_7" q:id="cv"><!--qv q:key=Os_2--><!--/qv--></div><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--qv q:key=QW_6--><!--qv q:id=cw q:key=vcaa:17--><!--qv q:id=cx q:key=fOK1:mL_1--><hr class="w-full border-0 my-4 bg-lightGrey h-1" q:key="Xt_0"><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--qv q:id=cy q:key=ekof:QW_1--><div style="" data-vo-slot="inline_18" data-vo-instance="01ktepekm9r6#inline_18" data-vo-slot-index="18" data-vo-article-index="0" data-vo-after-block="divider" class="my-5" q:key="Os_7" q:id="cz"><!--qv q:key=Os_2--><!--/qv--></div><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--qv q:key=QW_6--><!--qv q:id=d0 q:key=vcaa:<h3>More NBA from <em>Sports Illustrated</em></h3>--><!--qv q:id=d1 q:key=lY4S:mL_1--><h3 id="inline-text-18" class="my-[18px] [&amp;_a]:text-primary my-f-1.5" q:key="0" q:id="d2">More NBA from <em>Sports Illustrated</em></h3><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--qv q:id=d3 q:key=ekof:QW_1--><div style="" data-vo-slot="inline_19" data-vo-instance="01ktepekm9r6#inline_19" data-vo-slot-index="19" data-vo-article-index="0" data-vo-after-block="inline-text" class="my-5" q:key="Os_7" q:id="d4"><!--qv q:key=Os_2--><!--/qv--></div><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--qv q:key=QW_6--><!--qv q:id=d5 q:key=vcaa:<p>Listen to SI’s NBA podcast, <em>Open Floor</em>, below or on<a href="https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/open-floor-sis-nba-show/id1050847009"> Apple</a> and<a href="https://open.spotify.com/show/0Bgxp9XcFMTysIDB5mC04P"> Spotify</a>. Watch the show on<a href="https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLRxhb-2QRi1DlpVi8D3zH7WzJgtZXo72g"> SI’s YouTube channel</a>.</p>--><!--qv q:id=d6 q:key=lY4S:mL_1--><p id="inline-text-19" class="my-[18px] [&amp;_a]:text-primary my-f-1.5" q:key="0" q:id="d7">Listen to SI’s NBA podcast, <em>Open Floor</em>, below or on<a href="https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/open-floor-sis-nba-show/id1050847009"> Apple</a> and<a href="https://open.spotify.com/show/0Bgxp9XcFMTysIDB5mC04P"> Spotify</a>. Watch the show on<a href="https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLRxhb-2QRi1DlpVi8D3zH7WzJgtZXo72g"> SI’s YouTube channel</a>.</p><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--qv q:id=d8 q:key=ekof:QW_1--><div style="" data-vo-slot="inline_20" data-vo-instance="01ktepekm9r6#inline_20" data-vo-slot-index="20" data-vo-article-index="0" data-vo-after-block="inline-text" class="my-5" q:key="Os_7" q:id="d9"><!--qv q:key=Os_2--><!--/qv--></div><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--qv q:key=QW_6--><!--qv q:id=da q:key=vcaa:https://embed.podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/open-floor-sis-nba-show/id1050847009--><!--qv q:id=db q:key=SRoa:mL_1--><!--qv q:id=dc q:key=EEns:oZ_1--><div on:qvisible="q-BNYrJXx5.js#_hW[0]" q:key="1n_0" q:id="dd"></div><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--qv q:id=de q:key=ekof:QW_1--><div style="" data-vo-slot="inline_21" data-vo-instance="01ktepekm9r6#inline_21" data-vo-slot-index="21" data-vo-article-ind