    https://images2.minutemediacdn.com/image/upload/c_fill,w_540,ar_1:1,f_auto,q_auto,g_auto/page-builder%2Fuploads%2Fshape_cover_sport_tom_-_Tom_Dierberger-cff40455e1a5a6fde44318802b146685_1.jpg 3x" media="(min-width: 1080px)"><img src="https://images2.minutemediacdn.com/image/upload/c_fill,w_16,ar_16:9,f_auto,q_auto,g_auto/page-builder/uploads/shape_cover_sport_tom_-_Tom_Dierberger-cff40455e1a5a6fde44318802b146685_1.jpg" alt="Tom Dierberger" title="Tom Dierberger" width="180" height="180" class="rounded-full w-full w-full blur-[5px]" q:id="e1"></picture></div><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><!--/qv--><div class="flex flex-col flex-1"><a href="/author/tom-dierberger" data-testtype="author-link" class="font-group-tiny underline mb-1 text-primary">TOM DIERBERGER</a><p data-testtype="author-bio" class="font-group-big line-clamp-3 overflow-hidden text-ellipsis mb-4">Tom Dierberger leads Sports Illustrated’s NBA coverage as the Deputy News Director. He joined SI in November 2023 after stints at Fox Sports, Bally Sports and NBC Sports. Dierberger has a bachelor’s in communication from St. John’s University. In his spare time, he can be seen throwing out his arm while playing fetch with his dog, Walter B. Boy.</p><a href="https://twitter.com/tomdierberger" data-testtype="x-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="flex items-center gap-2 w-fit h-9 rounded-2xl bg-darkGrey hover:bg-primary cursor-pointer px-5 py-2.5" q:key="FU_4"><!--qv q:id=e2 q:key=i4KS:FU_3--><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" class="fill-white" q:key="7y_0" q:id="e3"><title>Share on X</title><path d="M12.6.75h2.454l-5.36 6.142L16 15.25h-4.937l-3.867-5.07-4.425 5.07H.316l5.733-6.57L0 .75h5.063l3.495 4.633L12.601.75Zm-.86 13.028h1.36L4.323 2.145H2.865z"></path></svg><!--/qv--><span class="font-group-tiny text-white">Follow tomdierberger</span></a></div></div><!--qv q:key=FU_6--><!--qv q:id=e4 q:key=1TQy:FU_5--><div data-testid="share-menu" class="